      "name": "GeoServer security advisory (AV26-1207)",
      "description": "Serial number: AV26-1207 Date: November 25, 2026 As of November 23 2026, GeoServer is affected by vulnerabilities in the following product: GeoServer \u2013 versions prior to 2.27.7 GeoServer \u2013 versions prior to 2.28.6 GeoServer \u2013 versions prior to 3.0.2 Open source reporting indicates that CVE-2026-120705 and CVE-2026-129243 are being exploited in the wild. The Cyber Centre encourages users and administrators to review the provided web link and apply any necessary updates as they become available.",
